 == سجل التغييرات ==
 
+= 2.28.4 =
+* M210 for the app dashboard (owner, 2026-11-07: «وعايزها تظهر برده في داشبورد للأدمن»): the admin account shape (`admin_accounts`, `admin_member`) carries `phone_verified` (1 while the current number is the one that received a WhatsApp code); `admin_accounts` takes `wa=yes|no` as a filter and answers `counts.wa_yes` / `counts.wa_no` over the unfiltered base. No schema change.
+
+= 2.28.3 =
+* M210 (owner, 2026-11-07: «يظهر عندي الأعضاء الموثقين عبر واتس اب والغير موثقين»): «الحسابات المسجّلة» shows per account whether the current number is WhatsApp-proven — a «WhatsApp» column with the badge «✅ موثّق عبر WhatsApp» or «⚠️ غير موثّق» in both the full list and the filtered view, plus a second pill row (counts of each, filter `wa=yes|no`) that combines with the فئة filter and survives the search. `VAI_Hub::accounts()` takes the filter as its fourth argument. No schema change.
+
 = 2.28.2 =
 * A Google or Apple sign-up can give its invite code with the profile: op_profile takes `referral` and `referral_kind` from the trusted app server, once, before any membership, and answers referred_by + referred_name. The admin mail that follows names the representative or the inviting member.
 
